{"id":"a15ef6697dd133a5","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-morphism-tests.md","title":"Theorem — 预层的单态射、满态射与同构逐点判别","display":"Theorem — 预层的单态射、满态射与同构逐点判别","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-morphism-tests","aliases":["14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-morphism-tests"],"display":"Theorem — 预层的单态射、满态射与同构逐点判别","source_ref":"I.2; I.5; VIII.8, p.441 (pointwise epi used)","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-isomorphism]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","[[14-thm-yoneda-lemma]]","[[14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-morphism-tests"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-morphism-tests</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 预层的单态射、满态射与同构逐点判别"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.2; I.5; VIII.8, p.441 (pointwise epi used)"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1291f8efcdef81cf\" href=\"?note=1291f8efcdef81cf\" title=\"14-thm-yoneda-lemma\">14-thm-yoneda-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"19ea095512403696\" href=\"?note=19ea095512403696\" title=\"14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits\">14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:P\\to Q\">\\(\\alpha:P\\to Q\\)</span> 为预层自然变换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsMono},\\operatorname{IsEpi},\\operatorname{IsIso}\">\\(\\operatorname{IsMono},\\operatorname{IsEpi},\\operatorname{IsIso}\\)</span> 在预层范畴中解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsMono}(\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall x,y\\in P(C)\\;(\\alpha_Cx=\\alpha_Cy\\Rightarrow x=y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsMono}(\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall x,y\\in P(C)\\;(\\alpha_Cx=\\alpha_Cy\\Rightarrow x=y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsEpi}(\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall q\\in Q(C)\\;\\exists p\\in P(C)\\;(\\alpha_Cp=q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsEpi}(\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall q\\in Q(C)\\;\\exists p\\in P(C)\\;(\\alpha_Cp=q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall q\\in Q(C)\\;\\exists!p\\in P(C)\\;(\\alpha_Cp=q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall q\\in Q(C)\\;\\exists!p\\in P(C)\\;(\\alpha_Cp=q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>分量单射时左消去逐点成立；反过来用 Yoneda 将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(C)\">\\(P(C)\\)</span> 的两个元素转成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"yC\\to P\">\\(yC\\to P\\)</span>，由单态射消去得到两元素相等。分量满射时右消去逐点成立；反向可用范畴判别：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 为满态射当且仅当把它与自身作推出所得两个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\to Q\\amalg_PQ\">\\(Q\\to Q\\amalg_PQ\\)</span> 相等，推出逐点计算；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_C\">\\(\\alpha_C\\)</span> 的像内，它在集合推出的两份副本不会等同，矛盾。分量逆映射的自然性由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 的自然性和双射性导出，得到最后的同构判别。这里结论只针对预层，不能直接移植为层的逐开集满射判别。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.2; I.5; VIII.8, p.441 (pointwise epi used)。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-yoneda-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"1291f8efcdef81cf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-yoneda-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"19ea095512403696","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha:P\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsMono},\\operatorname{IsEpi},\\operatorname{IsIso}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsMono}(\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall x,y\\in P(C)\\;(\\alpha_Cx=\\alpha_Cy\\Rightarrow x=y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsEpi}(\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall q\\in Q(C)\\;\\exists p\\in P(C)\\;(\\alpha_Cp=q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsIso}(\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall q\\in Q(C)\\;\\exists!p\\in P(C)\\;(\\alpha_Cp=q).","display":true},{"tex":"P(C)","display":false},{"tex":"yC\\to P","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\to Q\\amalg_PQ","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":2247,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-morphism-tests|thm-189 — 预层的单态射、满态射与同构逐点判别]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-morphism-tests]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-244","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-morphism-tests]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-morphism-tests]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-morphism-tests|thm-189 — 预层的单态射、满态射与同构逐点判别]]"},{"id":"abb55776f8cac91e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["d5f547b903550705","8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","1291f8efcdef81cf","19ea095512403696"]}